---
source: crates/surfaces/cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
The source places an entity is anchored to, or the entities a source file's facts are anchored to

Usage: specforge anchors [OPTIONS] [ENTITY]

Arguments:
  [ENTITY]
          Entity ID whose anchors to list

Options:
      --file <PATH>
          List the anchors of the located facts of this source file (a directory lists the files under it; a trailing part of a path matches it)

      --path <PATH>
          A path inside the project (the nearest directory at or above it holding specforge.json; none: the directory itself, with the default configuration)
          
          [default: .]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help
